      {
        "block_id": "MxakdP70KotEgwxCtxXcviIjnpf",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "LbvGdm9CBonex6xf77tcwxS7nUb",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "We are pleased to announce that our latest release includes a new feature that enables users to rename database collections. This feature is designed to help users better manage their database structure and make necessary changes without having to create new collections and migrate data.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "UJ97d7aytogHbsxBTuBcHBBinFe",
        "block_type": 12,
        "bullet": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Removal of storage quota",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        },
        "children": [
          "SW5Ndt20nomS4Ixxn7qc0K5hn5f",
          "CPqhdfVEZohey7x0RjccWhVLnmd"
        ],
        "parent_id": "INVidpiyDoaoQGxCxwWcK0ALnKe"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "SW5Ndt20nomS4Ixxn7qc0K5hn5f",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "UJ97d7aytogHbsxBTuBcHBBinFe",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "With this release, we have removed the storage quota from our platform. This means that users can now import data into an unloaded collection without having to worry about storage limits. Although there is no limit to data storage, the load capacity of each database is dependent on the size of the database. We strongly recommend that you use the Pricing Calculator to choose a suitable database size.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "CPqhdfVEZohey7x0RjccWhVLnmd",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "UJ97d7aytogHbsxBTuBcHBBinFe",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "In addition, we have also improved our user notifications when a database cannot fit into the pre-allocated CUs. Users will receive a notification when their database is beyond capacity. This will help users to better understand why their data failed to be imported and allow them to take appropriate actions.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "ZLBtdEqnaoAiW7x9fmpco1jDnAI",
        "block_type": 12,
        "bullet": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Improved credit-saving for inactive databases",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        },
        "children": [
          "ZoZydI1GxoyMRwxLlEwcfNFynNb"
        ],
        "parent_id": "INVidpiyDoaoQGxCxwWcK0ALnKe"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "ZoZydI1GxoyMRwxLlEwcfNFynNb",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "ZLBtdEqnaoAiW7x9fmpco1jDnAI",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "We have optimized the product logic and reminder notifications of inactive databases. If a user's database has been inactive for 14 consecutive days, we will automatically stop the database for the user to help save their free credits. Data security is always our top priority, so we will not delete any data from inactive databases. Users whose databases have been stopped can resume them at any time. In addition, we have updated our Terms of Service to include this optimization.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
